h=A.b(["EFS Attend is a mobile attendance management application built for field-based and on-site teams.","The app enables team leads to manage their teams by adding users and registering facial data directly within the application.","Attendance is marked using face recognition by capturing a single image, eliminating the need for manual check-ins.","Face recognition is integrated using on-device machine learning to ensure fast and reliable performance.","The application follows an offline-first approach, allowing attendance to be recorded even without an internet connection.","All offline data is securely stored in a local database for up to 45 days and automatically synced when connectivity is restored.","Location-based geofencing ensures attendance can only be marked within approved work areas.","To prevent misuse, the app blocks attendance marking if the device time is not properly synchronized.","The solution is developed in Flutter and supports both Android and iOS platforms."],i)
q=A.b(["Flutter","Provider","Firebase ML Kit","TensorFlow","SQLite","Firebase"],i)
q=A.DL(A.b(["Implemented face recognition\u2013based attendance using TensorFlow Lite and ML Kit with approximately 99% accuracy.","Designed and implemented an offline-first architecture with local data retention for up to 45 days.","Built seamless background synchronization to upload stored attendance data once internet access becomes available.","Integrated geofencing to restrict attendance marking to authorized physical locations.","Added device time validation to prevent attendance fraud caused by manual time changes.","Developed complete team management workflows allowing team leads to add users and register facial profiles."],i),"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.efs.efs_attend.efs_new","https://apps.apple.com/pk/app/efs-attend/id1586428507",k,h,"assets/images/projects/efs.webp",l,l,!0,q,"EFS Attend",l,l)
h=A.b(["Pantheon Coffee is a multi-role mobile application developed for a coffee house chain to manage sales, loyalty, and customer engagement.","The app supports three roles: Admin, Barista/Shop Owner, and Customer, each with dedicated features and workflows.","Admins can monitor live sales across all branches through graphical dashboards and manage outlets, users, products, and feedback.","Baristas and shop owners handle daily operations such as adding sales, managing invoices, and interacting with the loyalty system.","Invoices can be created by capturing receipt images, where OCR is used to automatically extract and fill invoice details.","Customers can explore outlets, view menus, track their order history, and engage with the loyalty program.","The app includes a points-based rewards system where users unlock free products based on accumulated points.","All users can manage their profiles, receive push notifications, and close their accounts if needed.","The application allows customers to create accounts independently without staff involvement."],i)
p=A.b(["Flutter","GetX","Laravel for REST API","Firebase","OCR","REST APIs"],i)
p=A.DL(A.b(["Designed and implemented a complete multi-role system with clearly separated admin, barista, and customer workflows.","Built real-time sales dashboards for admins to track branch-wise performance using graphical visualizations.","Implemented OCR-based invoice creation by extracting receipt data through image capture to reduce manual data entry.","Developed a loyalty and rewards system enabling point earning, redemption, and product unlocking based on thresholds.","Automated customer account creation during sales when a user does not already exist, with secure first-login password reset flow.","Enabled QR code scanning for free coffee redemptions and loyalty interactions.","Implemented sales, order history, and feedback viewing for both operational staff and customers.","Integrated push notifications across all roles for updates, offers, and system events."],i),"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.mtech.pantheon_cafe","https://apps.apple.com/pk/app/pantheon-coffee/id6737890124",k,h,"assets/images/projects/pantheon.webp",l,l,!0,p,"Pantheon Coffee",l,l)
h=A.b(["Sehat Sahoolat is a telehealth mobile application designed to connect patients and doctors through secure virtual consultations.","Both patients and doctors can sign up, complete their profiles, and manage appointments using real-time video calling.","Appointments are scheduled based on user time zones to ensure accurate and reliable consultation timing.","During consultations, doctors can add prescriptions and consultation notes that patients can access and download later.","Patients maintain a complete Electronic Medical Record (EMR) by entering personal health data, medical history, and reports.","The EMR includes family history, habits, allergies, medications, medical tests, and key vitals such as heart rate, BMI, and blood group.","Patients can select consultation packages and manage their appointments directly from the app.","Doctors can manage their professional profiles, including expertise, work experience, and supporting documents.","The app supports multi-device management, profile updates, account closure, and secure access across sessions."],i)
o=A.b(["Flutter","GetX","Agora","Firebase"],i)
o=A.DL(A.b(["Implemented real-time video consultations using Agora for reliable doctor\u2013patient communication.","Built a structured EMR system allowing patients to create, manage, and download complete medical records at any time.","Developed timezone-aware appointment scheduling to support users across different regions.","Enabled doctors to add prescriptions and consultation notes during live sessions with persistent patient access.","Implemented bidirectional feedback functionality allowing patients and doctors to review each other.","Created doctor finance management features to track earnings and consultation-related income.","Added role flexibility allowing doctors to switch to patient mode and manage EMRs for themselves and their family members.","Implemented secure device management to control active sessions across multiple devices.","Developed full account management features including profile editing and account closure for all users."],i),"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.app.sehat_sahoolat","https://apps.apple.com/pk/app/sehat-sahoolat/id6444405734",k,h,"assets/images/projects/sehat-sahoolat.webp",l,l,!0,o,"Sehat Sahoolat",l,l)
h=A.b(["RF Pro is a restaurant management application designed to help waiters and floor managers manage orders, tables, and daily restaurant operations from one place.","Restaurant staff can log in using their email and password or use a 4-digit PIN for faster access during busy operations.","Waiters can create orders, assign tables, add items to existing orders, customize items with extras and toppings, add tips, and print receipts directly from the application.","Floor managers have additional controls to change table and waiter assignments and modify orders when required.","Each restaurant table has a unique QR code that customers can scan to check their order status and request assistance from the assigned waiter.","When a customer calls a waiter, the assigned waiter receives a push notification identifying the table that needs assistance.","Customers can also submit feedback through the application based on their dining experience.","The application supports pre-booked orders, allowing staff to mark customers as arrived and continue the normal order process.","Sensitive order modifications are protected with a secure PIN to prevent unauthorized changes.","RF Pro works across mobile and tablet devices and is connected with the RF Pro CP application to manage the complete restaurant order workflow."],i)
n=A.b(["Flutter","GetX","REST APIs","Push Notifications",j],i)
n=A.DL(A.b(["Implemented separate workflows and permissions for waiters and floor managers.","Added 4-digit PIN login for faster access during busy restaurant operations.","Built complete order management including new orders, existing order updates, table assignment, customization, tips, and receipt printing.","Added support for item-level extras and topping options, allowing waiters to customize customer orders.","Implemented secure PIN-based authorization for sensitive order modifications.","Added table and waiter reassignment controls for floor managers.","Implemented QR code-based table identification, allowing customers to check their order status directly from their table.","Built a waiter calling system where customers can request assistance and the assigned waiter receives a push notification with the table number.","Implemented customer feedback functionality for collecting feedback directly through the application.","Implemented pre-booking management, allowing staff to handle reserved customers from arrival through order completion.","Built the front-of-house application to work with the kitchen and cashier workflows in RF Pro CP."],i),"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.mtech.rf_pro","https://apps.apple.com/pk/app/rf-pro/id6478156048",k,h,"assets/images/projects/rf-pro.webp",l,l,!0,n,"RF Pro",l,l)
h=A.b(["RF Pro CP is a restaurant kitchen and cashier management application designed for Windows desktop and tablet devices.","Orders created through RF Pro are sent to the appropriate kitchen where staff can manage incoming orders and update their status from cooking to served.","Kitchen staff can switch between multiple kitchens when a restaurant has separate kitchen operations.","The kitchen screen includes timers for complete orders as well as individual items, including items added to an existing order later.","The application also includes a complete cashier system for managing running orders, collecting payments, applying discounts, and completing orders.","Cashiers can temporarily hold orders and continue processing them later without losing the order details.","Orders can be filtered using dynamically configured categories such as dine-in, takeaway, and delivery platforms such as Foodpanda.","Payment methods and discount options are dynamic, allowing the restaurant to support different payment types such as cash and card.","Cashiers can print receipts, manage completed and running orders, and print receipts for previous orders.","The register system allows cashiers to open the register at the start of the day and close it at the end, with transactions handled while the register is open.","Cashiers can export order reports containing completed and running orders along with their total values.","RF Pro CP is connected with RF Pro through REST APIs and works as part of the same restaurant management ecosystem."],i)
